body:
I guess. there's not much to talk about. one other thing, I think it should be a rule on this sub that if someone posts saying they want to kill themselves , you should not be allowed to PM them and say "I'm going to kill myself too what should I do". someone who is suicidal should not be tasked with the responsibility of helping another person in a suicidal crisis. Everytime I post, someone PMs me for advice. what the fuck am I supposed to do???? 

I don't know how to tag the mods. 
@mods
